<title>GERMANY: German Nov new car registrations fall 0.8pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>German Nov new car registrations fall 0.8pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>FLENSBURG, Germany 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>New car registrations in Germany fell by 0.8 percent in November from the same month in 1995, the Federal Motor Office said on Friday.</p>
<p>In the first 11 months of 1996, car registrations were up 5.9 percent against a year earlier.</p>
<p>		     November	Pct chg/mt/mt  Pct chg/Nov 95</p>
<p>    Cars	   260,066	  -9.0		   -0.8</p>
<p>    Trucks	 18,953	   +5.0		   +11.4</p>
<p>    All vehicles 292,987	  -8.5		   +1.7</p>
<p>				Jan-Nov 1996	Yr/Yr pct change</p>
<p>    Cars		    3,263,323		 +5.9</p>
<p>    Trucks		    181,768		 -5.6</p>
<p>    All vehicles	  3,782,109		 +6.3</p>
</text>
